            </p>
            
            <div class="mt-8 sm:mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto px-4">
                <a href="https://discord.com/oauth2/authorize?client_id=1407885636135944342&permissions=2150755584&integration_type=0&scope=bot+applications.commands" 
                   class="btn-studio-primary w-full sm:w-auto text-xs sm:text-sm !py-3 !px-6 rounded-xl">
